title: KnightDialogueBranch1
position: 8,-262
tags:
---
// Determines if the dialogue for submitting a potion is available
<<declare $isHoldingPotion = false>>
<<declare $isPotionPassable = false>>
<<declare $orderMain = "WARMING">>
<<declare $orderLesserName = "">>
<<declare $potionScore = 0>>
<<declare $potionsGiven = 0>>

// free play after the first potion
<<if $potionsGiven > 0>>
    <<jump KnightFreePlay>>
<<endif>>

Ferdinand: "Well met, young apothecary!"
Ferdinand: "You may call me Ferdinand, a knight of renown."

<<jump KnightHub>>
===

title: KnightHub
position: 7,-61
---

Ferdinand: "I heard that this was the finest procurer of potions in all the land. I require a concoction that will allow me to maintain my flame. Can you conjure such a spell for me?"

-> [Give Potion] <<if $isHoldingPotion is true>>
    <<jump KnightGivePotion>>
-> [What happened to your body?]{talk_cost("KnightBody")} <<if can_talk("KnightBody")>>
    <<spend_talk_amount CUSTOMER_SPRITE KnightBody>>
    <<jump KnightBody>>
-> [What can you tell me about Emberseed?]{talk_cost("KnightEmberseed")} <<if can_talk("KnightEmberseed")>>
    <<spend_talk_amount CUSTOMER_SPRITE KnightEmberseed>>
    <<jump KnightEmberseed>>
-> [Have you heard anything about my mentor?]{talk_cost("KnightMentor")} <<if can_talk("KnightMentor")>>
    <<spend_talk_amount CUSTOMER_SPRITE KnightMentor>>
    <<jump KnightMentor>>
-> [You've heard of this shop before?]{talk_cost("KnightShop")} <<if can_talk("KnightShop")>>
    <<spend_talk_amount CUSTOMER_SPRITE KnightShop>>
    <<jump KnightShop>>
-> [Small talk]
    <<jump KnightSmallTalk>>
-> [Exit]
    <<jump KnightLeaveTalk>>
===

title: KnightBody
position: -560,177
---
Ferdinand: "Alas, I was slain in the midst of battle."
Ferdinand: "A traveling necromancer was able to return my soul, but not my body."
Ferdinand: "Now this flame of mine, my undying will, shall burn forevermore."
-> [I see. Thank you.]
    <<jump KnightHub>>
===

title: KnightEmberseed
position: 535,107
---
Ferdinand: "Ah, Emberseed, you say?"
Ferdinand: "I couldn't tell you much about the seeds themselves, unfortunately."
Ferdinand: "But I do distinctly remember coming across the Ember Flower on one of my travels."
Ferdinand: "Had a very pungent smell. We could hardly fall asleep at night because the stench would keep us all awake!"
-> [Can you tell me more about your travels?]
    <<jump KnightTravels>>
-> [I see. Thank you.]
    <<jump KnightHub>>
===

title: KnightTravels
position: 380,282
---
Ferdinand: "Well, if you'll allow me to regale you with some tales, then regale you I shall!"
Ferdinand: "Allow me to tell you the tale of the time a group of brigands and I came across a griffin."
Ferdinand: "The beast was ferocious, and we lost a few good men."
Ferdinand: "But alas, we managed to fell the beast, and take its claws."
Ferdinand: "I still keep the claw in my vault as a memory of our victory, and to honor my fallen comrades."
-> [I see. Thank you.]
    <<jump KnightHub>>
===

title: KnightMentor
position: 140,274
---
Ferdinand: "Unfortunately not, my friend."
Ferdinand: "I have yet to hear the name throughout my travels."
-> [Do you know where they may have gone?]
    Ferdinand: "Any answer I could give you at this time would be mere speculation, young apothecary."
    Ferdinand: "My apologies."
    <<jump KnightHub>>
===

title: KnightShop
position: -98,261
---
Ferdinand: "But of course! From land to land, people tell the tale of this very shop."
Ferdinand: "I have known you for exactly 3 minutes, and already I trust you with my life!"
-> [I see. Thank you.]
    <<jump KnightHub>>
===

title: KnightSmallTalk
position: -326,222
---
Ferdinand: "My goodness! Is it just me, or is it growing quite warm in here?"
Ferdinand: "Only kidding, of course."
<<jump KnightHub>>
