title: KnightLeaveTalk
position: 795,287
---
Ferdinand: "I await my potion still."
===

title: KnightGivePotion
position: -889,366
---
Ferdinand: "Hmmm..."
<<grade_potion CUSTOMER_SPRITE>>
<<if $potionsGiven > 1>>
    <<jump KnightGradePotion>>
<<endif>>
<<if $isPotionPassable is true>>
    Ferdinand: "Well done, young apothecary."
<<else>>
    Ferdinand: "Perhaps I can fulfill my needs elsewhere."
<<endif>>
-> [Free Play]
===

title: KnightGradePotion
position: -1189,366
---
<<if $potionScore >= 90>>
    => Ferdinand: "Magnificent! This is exactly what I needed, young apothecary."
    => Ferdinand: "Splendid work! The bards shall sing of this brew."
<<elseif $isPotionPassable is true>>
    => Ferdinand: "Well done, young apothecary."
    => Ferdinand: "Not quite perfect, but it shall serve me well."
<<else>>
    => Ferdinand: "Perhaps I can fulfill my needs elsewhere."
    => Ferdinand: "Hmm. This is not quite what I asked for, I'm afraid."
<<endif>>
-> [Free Play]
===

title: KnightFreePlay
position: -1189,566
---
<<detour KnightOrder>>
-> [Give Potion] <<if $isHoldingPotion is true>>
    <<jump KnightGivePotion>>
-> [Exit]
===

title: KnightOrder
position: -889,566
---
=> Ferdinand: "The cold creeps into my armor of late. Brew me something warming, if you would. And just a hint of {$orderLesserName}." <<if $orderMain == "WARMING">>
=> Ferdinand: "My flame flickers in this chill. I need something to warm my very soul. And just a hint of {$orderLesserName}." <<if $orderMain == "WARMING">>
=> Ferdinand: "My flame burns too hot of late. My squire's eyebrows have yet to grow back. Something chilling, perhaps? And just a hint of {$orderLesserName}." <<if $orderMain == "CHILLING">>
=> Ferdinand: "Battle leaves my armor glowing red hot. I require something chilling to cool it. And just a hint of {$orderLesserName}." <<if $orderMain == "CHILLING">>
=> Ferdinand: "My comrades returned from the frontier battered and bruised. They need something healing. And just a hint of {$orderLesserName}." <<if $orderMain == "HEALING">>
=> Ferdinand: "A healing draught for my steed, if you please. The poor beast took an arrow meant for me. And just a hint of {$orderLesserName}." <<if $orderMain == "HEALING">>
=> Ferdinand: "A wyvern has been terrorizing the village. I need a poison strong enough to fell it. And just a hint of {$orderLesserName}." <<if $orderMain == "POISON">>
=> Ferdinand: "Rats have overrun the castle cellars. Something poisonous, if you would, and be discreet. And just a hint of {$orderLesserName}." <<if $orderMain == "POISON">>
=> Ferdinand: "The catacombs beneath the keep are dark as pitch. I need something that glows. And just a hint of {$orderLesserName}." <<if $orderMain == "GLOWING">>
=> Ferdinand: "My flame alone cannot light the long road ahead. Brew me something glowing. And just a hint of {$orderLesserName}." <<if $orderMain == "GLOWING">>
=> Ferdinand: "Brigands guard the mountain pass. Something blinding would let us slip by. And just a hint of {$orderLesserName}." <<if $orderMain == "BLINDING">>
=> Ferdinand: "I face a gorgon at dawn. I would rather not look upon it, nor it upon me. Something blinding. And just a hint of {$orderLesserName}." <<if $orderMain == "BLINDING">>
=> Ferdinand: "A thief stole my family crest and vanished into thin air. I need something revealing. And just a hint of {$orderLesserName}." <<if $orderMain == "REVEALING">>
=> Ferdinand: "There is a hidden door somewhere in the old ruins. Help me reveal it. And just a hint of {$orderLesserName}." <<if $orderMain == "REVEALING">>
=> Ferdinand: "My squire will not stop singing. Something silencing, I beg of you. And just a hint of {$orderLesserName}." <<if $orderMain == "SILENCING">>
=> Ferdinand: "We must sneak past a sleeping dragon. Something silencing would serve us well. And just a hint of {$orderLesserName}." <<if $orderMain == "SILENCING">>
=> Ferdinand: "Cursed vines have overtaken the castle walls. I need something to wither them. And just a hint of {$orderLesserName}." <<if $orderMain == "WITHERING">>
=> Ferdinand: "A grumpy treant blocks the forest road. Something withering ought to persuade it. And just a hint of {$orderLesserName}." <<if $orderMain == "WITHERING">>
=> Ferdinand: "I wish to preserve the griffin's claw for all eternity. Something crystallizing would do. And just a hint of {$orderLesserName}." <<if $orderMain == "CRYSTALLIZING">>
=> Ferdinand: "The bridge over the river has collapsed. If the water were crystallized, we could simply walk across. And just a hint of {$orderLesserName}." <<if $orderMain == "CRYSTALLIZING">>
=> Ferdinand: "The castle baths have gone cold and still. Something bubbling would liven them up. And just a hint of {$orderLesserName}." <<if $orderMain == "BUBBLING">>
=> Ferdinand: "The jester requests something bubbling for the feast. Do not ask me why. And just a hint of {$orderLesserName}." <<if $orderMain == "BUBBLING">>
=> Ferdinand: "The tournament is upon us, and my lance arm is not what it once was. Something strengthening. And just a hint of {$orderLesserName}." <<if $orderMain == "STRENGTHENING">>
=> Ferdinand: "My shield grows heavier with every battle. I need a strengthening tonic. And just a hint of {$orderLesserName}." <<if $orderMain == "STRENGTHENING">>
